# the prompt runs Eve lines in one session scope: a variable of one line is seen by the next, an expression is printed, an error does not end the session (F-TLS-03)
** spec: semantics/repl.md#prompt-lines
primary aspect c60_repl_session is
  process main is
    print "unused";
  return;
end c60_repl_session;
